elect menu, date picker, file input, checkbox and option groups all show on long press on phones too.",[337,338,340],"h2",{"id":339},"usage","Usage",[342,343,345],"h3",{"id":344},"tooltip-text","Tooltip text",[308,347,348,351,352,355,356,355,359,362,363,366],{},[312,349,350],{},"text"," is the tooltip content, and the trigger goes in the default slot. Props such as ",[312,353,354],{},"kbds",", ",[312,357,358],{},"content",[312,360,361],{},"arrow"," and ",[312,364,365],{},"delayDuration"," are the same as Nuxt UI.",[368,369],"component-example",{"name":344},[342,371,373],{"id":372},"touch-long-press","Touch long press",[308,375,376],{},"On touch devices, holding the trigger for about 0.5 seconds shows the tooltip, which stays open after you lift your finger and closes when you tap elsewhere or scroll the page.",[378,379,380,384,387,390],"ul",{},[381,382,383],"li",{},"When a long press shows the tooltip, lifting your finger does not trigger the trigger's own action (click, check, open a menu and so on).",[381,385,386],{},"A normal tap triggers the original action as usual without showing the tooltip; focus caused by a tap does not show it either.",[381,388,389],{},"Moving your finger after pressing counts as scrolling and does not show the tooltip.",[381,391,392],{},"During a long press, the browser's long-press menu is not shown and text inside the trigger is not selected (except in inputs).",[308,394,395,396,399,400,403],{},"With ",[312,397,398],{},"touch"," set to ",[312,401,402],{},"false",", it behaves like the original Nuxt UI tooltip and touch cannot open it.",[368,405],{"name":406},"tooltip-touch",[308,408,409,410,413,414,328],{},"To turn it off site-wide, set ",[312,411,412],{},"components.tooltip.touch: false","; the tooltips inside the library turn off too. See ",[415,416,42],"a",{"href":417},"\u002Fgetting-started\u002Ftheme\u002Fcomponent-defaults",[342,419,421],{"id":420},"open-state","Open state",[308,423,424,425,428,429,328],{},"Bind the open state with ",[312,426,427],{},"v-model:open"," to open or close it from code; without binding, set the initial state with ",[312,430,431],{},"default-open",[368,433],{"name":434},"tooltip-open",[337,436,438],{"id":437},"props","Props",[440,441],"component-props",{"name":318},[337,443,445],{"id":444},"slots","Slots",[447,448,449,462],"table",{},[450,451,452],"thead",{},[453,454,455,459],"tr",{},[456,457,458],"th",{},"Slot",[456,460,461],{},"Description",[463,464,465,476],"tbody",{},[453,466,467,473],{},[468,469,470],"td",{},[312,471,472],{},"default",[468,474,475],{},"The trigger",[453,477,478,482],{},[468,479,480],{},[312,481,358],{},[468,483,484,485],{},"Custom tooltip content, like Nuxt UI's ",[312,486,358],{},[337,488,490],{"id":489},"changelog","Changelog",[492,493],"component-changelog",{"name":318},{"title":495,"searchDepth":496,"depth":496,"links":497},"",2,[498,504,505,506],{"id":339,"depth":496,"text":340,"children":499},[500,502,503],{"id":344,"depth":501,"text":345},3,{"id":372,"depth":501,"text":373},{"id":420,"depth":501,"text":421},{"id":437,"depth":496,"text":438},{"id":444,"depth":496,"text":445},{"id":489,"depth":496,"text":490},"Tooltip built on UTooltip that adds long press on touch devices.","md",[510],{"label":314,"icon":511,"to":512,"target":513},"i-simple-icons-nuxtdotjs","https:\u002F\u002Fui.nuxt.com\u002Fdocs\u002Fcomponents\u002Ftooltip","_blank",{},{"title":217,"icon":220},{"title":217,"description":507},"4565oldi4mLlQ23DDtLB3PNuatpzumlaK2Y6aSQ2HM4",[519,521],{"title":212,"path":213,"stem":214,"description":520,"icon":215,"children":-1},"Info icon with a tooltip, shown on hover, keyboard focus or long press on touch devices.",{"title":62,"path":232,"stem":233,"description":522,"icon":65,"children":-1},"Shared validation rules for Valibot, with consistent error messages across the site.",1795072359049]